# AURELIA — environment
#
# The project has no backend and no secrets. The single optional variable
# below is a public form-action URL, not a credential: it is read in the
# browser and appears in the client bundle by design.
#
# Leave it unset and the enquiry form composes the message and hands it to
# the visitor's mail client instead of pretending to deliver it. Set it to
# an endpoint that accepts a JSON POST and the form starts using it with no
# other change. See lib/contact/enquiry.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
